-- id: exp6987-contrast-feature-audit
-  title: Independent contrast balance and leakage audit
-  track: verification
-  priority: critical
-  agent_type: codex
-  model: gpt-5.6-sol
-  requires_gpu: false
-  max_turns: 30
-  estimated_wall_time_min: 90
-  per_unit_rows: true
-  prior_failures:
-    - experiment_id: exp5869-hardness-surface-headroom-audit
-      verdict: "blocked: test_exit_codes"
-      addressed_by: "Exp6987 audits a frozen three-family feature bank with explicit command receipts, per-row shortcut probes, and a terminal fail-closed artifact even when a test exits nonzero."
-      retire_if_same_verdict: true
-  milestone: 2026.09.612
-  deliverable: results/experiment_6987_contrast_feature_audit.json
-  gated_on:
-    - upstream: exp6986-three-family-contrast-features
-      artifact_field: three_family_feature_bank_complete_score
-      op: '=='
-      value: 1
-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    Exp6986 joins exact labels only after three isolated model-scoring passes.
-    A balanced dataset can still leak through source IDs, mutation metadata,
-    serialization style, candidate order, length, or model identity. PWA-KAN
-    training must wait for an independent audit of those shortcuts.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6984_exact_contrast_fixture.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6985_chronological_constraint_stream.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6986_three_family_contrast_features.json
-    - {project_root}/scripts/experiments/experiment_6986_three_family_contrast_features.py
-    - {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/constraint-verification/spec.md
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md
-
-    TASK:
-    Audit the frozen feature bank in a fresh read-only process. Recompute row
-    counts, balance, joins, hashes, split isolation, and label-denial evidence.
-    Measure prohibited provenance shortcuts before releasing the bank to
-    training.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require three_family_feature_bank_complete_score=1, all
-       414 rows, the raw and joined hashes, both fixture hashes, and read-only
-       access. On failure, write blocked_contrast_feature_audit with
-       gate_check_summary.
-    1. Add REQ-VERIFY-6987 and RED tests before implementation. Cover missing
-       model rows, duplicate joins, label imbalance, source overlap, future
-       leakage, direct label columns, provenance shortcuts, and bare readiness.
-    2. Start a fresh process with network, GPU, LLM, and source writes disabled.
-       Hash every source before reading aggregate claims.
-    3. Rebuild all 414 candidate-model joins from raw rows. Recompute exact
-       candidate counts, family coverage, balance by split, and source-group
-       disjointness. Preserve every disagreement.
-    4. Confirm that the model process inputs contain no label, fault family,
-       split, source group, recurrence link, future window, or authority result.
-       Confirm the training feature schema excludes those fields and IDs.
-    5. Fit preregistered shortcut probes using length only, serialization only,
-       source metadata only, mutation metadata only, and model identity only.
-       Use grouped cross-validation and report intervals from per-pair rows.
-    6. Set feature_audit_complete_score=1 when every row and receipt replays.
-       Set contrast_feature_bank_ready_score=1 only when direct leakage count is
-       zero, splits are balanced and disjoint, all models are complete, and no
-       prohibited provenance-only probe has an upper CI at or above 0.80 AUROC.
-    7. A failed shortcut gate is terminal disqualification, not a repair or
-       partial result. Do not rewrite Exp6984, Exp6985, or Exp6986.
-    8. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, artifact validation,
-       adversarial verification, row-consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.
-    9. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one scientific
-       principle per required field and both feature_audit_complete_score and
-       contrast_feature_bank_ready_score; preconditions_checked;
-       inference_substrate (fresh_process_contrast_leakage_audit_no_llm);
-       duration_s; source_artifact_hashes; rows; per_candidate_model_rows;
